{"text": "Energy saving rate may vary by region, model, size, viewing conditions and type of content. Products shipped in Eco Mode have some AI Energy Mode functions enabled by default, so energy saving levels when AI Energy Mode is turned on may appear lower compared to Standard Mode. AI Energy Mode does not work with Game Mode. Energy savings are based on internal test results and may vary depending on the content being displayed and surrounding brightness levels. Control your TV from your phone (Quick Remote) Through your mobile device, you can access key Samsung Tizen TV features such as media, features, ambient mode and menu. Quick Remote can also act as your TV remote, allowing you to change channels, adjust the volume and more right from your phone. Push notifications for mobile remotes for TVs are available on (Mobile) Android OS 10.0 and higher versions with (TV) 2020 Samsung TVs and later models, and operates when the mobile device is near the TV. Samsung Smart TV feature access is available on (TV) 2024 Samsung TVs and later models with (Mobile) Android OS 10.0 and higher versions or iOS 15.0 and higher versions. Transform your TV into a karaoke stage (Karaoke) Have fun with friends and family with the karaoke feature in Samsung Daily+. You can even connect your phone to use as a mic. No need for any separate equipment \u2014 your singing setup is already here. Requires SmartThings app to be installed on the mobile device and connected via the same Wi-Fi network as the TV set.", "source": "d:\\SEMESTER 4\\AI Final Project\\Multi-Agent-RAG\\data\\65_QLED_Q8F_4K_Samsung_Vision_AI_Smart_TV_(2025).pdf", "page": 3}